<title>USA: ST PAUL HOGS STEADY/$0.50 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST PAUL HOGS STEADY/$0.50 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 lower. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   55.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   55.00-55.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4 package 295 lbs   51.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady, instances 0.50 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   45.00-46.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   46.50, few 47.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
